n using a Northern Fishburger, Green Sparkles Effect <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Green Sparkles Effect\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Green_Sparkles_Effect_f26b9f.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> will appear on the user who will get the following message: \"<span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">You suddenly feel like the best fisherman in the whole world.</span>\"\n</p><p><b>Necessary Ingredients:</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li>1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Northern%20Pike\">Northern Pike</a> <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Northern Pike\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Northern_Pike_8e10b6.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></li>\n<li>1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Rainbow%20Trout\">Rainbow Trout</a> <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Rainbow Trout\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Rainbow_Trout_b08ae9.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></li>\n<li>1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Perch\">Green Perch</a> <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Green Perch\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Green_Perch_8933ab.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></li>\n<li>5 <a href=\"#/wiki/Shrimp\">Shrimps</a> <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Shrimp\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Shrimp_374461.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></li>\n<li>2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Roll\">Rolls</a> <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Roll\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Roll_24048e.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></li>\n<li>1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Fern\">Fern</a> <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Fern\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Fern_29c59a.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></li></ul>\n<p>Only obtainable through the <a href=\"#/quest/hot-cuisine-quest\">Hot Cuisine Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"><li>This item is not dropped by any creatures.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC sells this item.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC buys this item.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Fern\">Fern</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Food\">Food</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Perch\">Green Perch</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/hot-cuisine-quest\">Hot Cuisine Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Northern%20Pike\">Northern Pike</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Rainbow%20Trout\">Rainbow Trout</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/river-runs-deep-mini-world-change\">River Runs Deep Mini World Change</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Roll\">Roll</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Shrimp\">Shrimp</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["hot-cuisine-quest","river-runs-deep-mini-world-change"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"hot-cuisine-quest","quest":"Hot Cuisine Quest","step":"2-8","n":15,"title":"Prato 9: Northern Fishburger","kind":"reward","coords":[{"x":33